      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(gateway): defer hot-reload restart when dist/entry.js is missing",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nPushing commits into a live production git checkout triggers the gateway's hot-reload while `dist/` is mid-rebuild. The watcher (`requestRestart()` in `scripts/watch-node.mjs`) immediately sends SIGTERM to the current healthy child process without checking whether the replacement build is valid for the new checkout state. The new child cannot start → crash-loop until systemd's start-limit is exhausted (37-min outage, P1, issue #99603).\n\n## Changes\n\nThree layers in `scripts/watch-node.mjs`:\n\n### 1. isBuildReadyForRestart(cwd, fs, resolveHead)\n\nComprehensive guard mirroring `run-node`'s `resolveBuildRequirement()`:\n- `dist/entry.js` exists\n- Build stamp (`dist/.buildstamp`) has valid `builtAt`\n- Build stamp git HEAD matches current checkout HEAD\n- Config files (`tsdown.config.ts`, `tsconfig.json`, `package.json`) mtime not newer than stamp\n- Runtime postbuild stamp (`dist/.runtime-postbuildstamp`) exists with `syncedAt >= builtAt`\n\n### 2. Deferred restart polling (1s interval)\n\nWhen build is not ready, polls every 1s. When build output becomes ready, auto-triggers restart — no manual file change needed.\n\n### 3. Exit handler guard\n\nAfter SIGTERM/143 child exit, verifies build readiness before restarting. Prevents self-reinforcing crash-loop.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Real gateway:watch proof (current SHA 03954beb)\n\n```\nREAL gateway:watch PROOF — SHA: 03954beb32ea\nHostname: LIN-66D8BD4EA2C\nNode: v24.13.1\n\n─── 1. isBuildReadyForRestart ───\n  ✅ entry.js missing → false\n  ✅ no readFileSync (fallback) → true\n  ✅ HEAD mismatch (has runtime stamp) → false\n  ✅ HEAD match (has runtime stamp) → true\n\n─── 2. Guard points in source ───\n  Guard checks: 3 (requestRestart + exit handler + polling)\n  Polling reset on settle: yes\n  isBuildReadyForRestart exported: yes\n\n─── 3. Unit tests ───\n  Test Files  1 passed (1), Tests  24 passed (24)\n\n─── 4. Lint ───\n  Found 0 warnings and 0 errors.\n```\n\n### Unit tests (24/24 passed)\n\n```\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run src/infra/watch-node.test.ts\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  24 passed (24)\n```\n\n### Broader regression (91/91 passed)\n\n```\n$ node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run src/infra/run-node.test.ts src/infra/watch-node.test.ts\n Test Files  2 passed (2)\n      Tests  91 passed (91)\n```\n\n### CI status\n\nAll checks-node-compact-small-* pass. Lint + type-check clean.\n\n## Review\n\n- Manually reviewed and verified\n- AI-assisted: Yes\n- **Partial mitigation** — prevents crash-loop; issue #99603 should remain open for transactional restart (build-then-swap)\n- Competing PRs #99610, #99972 target same root cause; maintainers should choose one canonical fix",
